@@ -144,6 +144,43 @@ The quickest possible way to get Kuksa Databroker up and running.
 *Note that not all APIs are enabled by default, see [user guide](doc/user_guide.md) and*
 *[protocols](doc/protocol.md) for more information!*
 
+### Local mw::com provider demo
+
+This checkout includes `mw_com_provider` as a workspace member and a local demo runner that starts Kuksa Databroker and the S-Core LoLa provider in the same process.
+
+The full setup, integration details, run commands, and troubleshooting notes are documented in [doc/mw_com_provider_demo.md](doc/mw_com_provider_demo.md).
+
+Start the S-Core vehicle-dynamics producer in one terminal from the S-Core communication checkout:
+
+```sh
+cd /mnt/c/Shares/ToRutuja/ToPrashanth/communication
+bazel run //score/mw/com/example/vehicle-dynamics-example:vehicle-dynamics-example -- \
+  --run-mode producer \
+  --service-instance-manifest /home/pmj3kor/score/mwcom_provider_M1/Inisetup/kuksa-databroker/mw_com_provider/generated/vehicle_dynamics_lola_config.json
+```
+
+Start Databroker with the in-process mw::com provider in another terminal:
+
+```fish
+cd /home/pmj3kor/score/mwcom_provider_M1/Inisetup/kuksa-databroker
+
+set -gx SCORE_COM_BAZEL_BIN "/mnt/c/Shares/ToRutuja/ToPrashanth/communication/New folder_generatedFilesAfterBuild/bazel-bin"
+set -gx LD_LIBRARY_PATH "$SCORE_COM_BAZEL_BIN/score/mw/com/impl/bindings/lola:$SCORE_COM_BAZEL_BIN/score/mw/com/impl/rust/com-api/com-api-ffi-lola:$SCORE_COM_BAZEL_BIN/score/mw/com/example/vehicle-dynamics-example/com-api-gen:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH"
+cargo run -p databroker-mw-com-demo
+```
+
+Then subscribe from the Databroker CLI:
+
+```sh
+cargo run -p databroker-cli --no-default-features -- --server http://127.0.0.1:55555
+```
+
+At the CLI prompt:
+
+```console
+subscribe Vehicle.Speed
+```
+
 ### Reading and writing VSS data using the CLI (interactive)
 
 1. Start the CLI in a container attached to the _kuksa_ bridge network and connect to the Databroker container:
